The Field Health mod (scripts, textures, labels, icons, artwork and texts) by MatrikSky is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
You are free to copy, share, modify and publish your own versions of this mod, provided that you:
